sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as Counter App
  participant Local as Edge Postgres
  participant Agent as Sync Agent (Go)
  participant Cloud as Sync Engine
  participant PG as Cloud Postgres
  App->>Local: Write (register / bill / result) — always local-first
  Local-->>Agent: Change log (CDC), ULID/UUIDv7 ids
  Note over App,Agent: Internet outage — lab keeps operating
  Agent->>Cloud: Push changes + pull cloud deltas (when online, resumable)
  Cloud->>Cloud: Reconcile — append-only / per-field LWW
  Cloud->>Cloud: Money records — domain reconciliation (no blind LWW)
  Cloud->>PG: Apply authoritative state
  Cloud-->>Agent: Deltas + conflict resolutions + revocations
  Agent->>Local: Apply (idempotent)
